<title>BAHRAIN: TABLE-SAUDI'S TABUK AGRICULTURAL H1 NET SURGES.</title>
<headline>TABLE-SAUDI'S TABUK AGRICULTURAL H1 NET SURGES.</headline>
<dateline>MANAMA 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997</p>
<p>			   (million Saudi riyals)</p>
<p> Net profit		  8.8   vs    1.4</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	   10.2   vs    3.0</p>
<p> Sales income	     53.8   vs   48.1</p>
<p> Sales cost		 34.2   vs   34.5</p>
<p> Net operating income    9.5   vs    2.9</p>
<p> Other income		0.6   vs    0.1</p>
<p> Shareholders' funds   405.1   vs  399.4</p>
<p>Full Name: Tabuk Agricultural Development Company.</p>
<p>-- Bahrain newsroom 973-524424.</p>
</text>
